WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:01.750
Before anyone else,

2
00:00:01.950 --> 00:00:04.480
give yourselves the loudest round of applause

3
00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:06.250
for making it here this evening.

4
00:00:06.380 --> 00:00:07.740
You’re looking spectacular.

5
00:00:07.920 --> 00:00:09.450
Make some noise for yourselves. Come on.

6
00:00:11.720 --> 00:00:13.520
Can you promise me that you will applaud

7
00:00:13.520 --> 00:00:16.080
for all the winners who will take the stage this evening?

8
00:00:16.160 --> 00:00:16.950
Is that a promise?

9
00:00:17.330 --> 00:00:18.120
Good afternoon.

10
00:00:18.520 --> 00:00:21.560
A warm and a hearty welcome to each one of you,

11
00:00:21.560 --> 00:00:22.950
to Tales to Tell.

12
00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:54.620
Similarly, ladies and gentlemen, it is you,

13
00:00:54.950 --> 00:00:57.550
each one of you sitting over here.
